    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a slump. i can feel it. i look at my old work and then i look at what i'm doing now and it's embarrassing. like, i'm just a fraud pretending to still have it. why bother trying to \"push\" through when the truth is i've already peaked? it feels more dignified to just walk away now before i become a complete joke of myself.",
