      "content": "it's not just about the art, though. it's everything. if the one thing that defined me is dead, what am i even doing here? i feel like i'm just taking up space. like, i'd rather just stop everything now—to just let it all be over—while i still have some shred of who i used to be, instead of dragging out this slow, pathetic decline.",
